      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aMacerator§r\n\nSqueezed Collision of Material.\nThis is way better than a forge hammer.\nCan parallel up to 2 ^ (2 ^ (Tier + 2) - 1).\nTier is determined by cotainment block: Damascus Steel, Neutronium, Universium.\nThe max voltage tier is limited by the glass tier.\nEnable 8x speed multiplier when glass tier > recipe tier.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Output Bus, Energy Hatch, Maintenance Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); Naquadah Alloy Frame Boxes; Cosmic Neutronium Frame Boxes; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembler, ZPM\n - 64x Maceration Stack\n - 16x Macerator ZPM\n - 16x ZPM Circuit\n - 64x Maceration Upgrade Chip\n - Ademic Steel\n - 16x Electric Motor UV\n - 8x Superconductor ZPM 4x Wire\n - Adamantium Alloy\n - 9,216x Solder Ind Alloy",
